    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pontĭfĭcālis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		pontifex, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a
			pontifex</i>, <i>pontifical</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insignia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					10, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auctoritas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 2, 21, 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">honos,</span>”
				<i>of the Pontifex Maximus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					3, 420</span></i>
			: ludi, <i>given by the</i> Pontifex Maximus 
			<i>on his entrance into office</i>, <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 44</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lectio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 13, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
